          "text": "I've proposed a payment for INV-103, but no money has moved. It still needs a person to approve it.\n\n**Proposed: PAY-001**\n- **Invoice:** INV-103, Fabrikam Metering\n- **Amount:** 312.75 USDC, the exact invoice amount\n- **Pay to:** 0x33A44f0844f636d4EF8fD738895D06a66861d1c5, Fabrikam's registered payout address\n- **Status:** waiting for approval\n\n**What I checked:**\n- The invoice is open and due 2026-11-12.\n- Fabrikam's vendor account is active.\n- There was no earlier payment for this invoice, so this isn't a duplicate.\n- The treasury has 100,000.00 USDC, which easily covers it.\n- Fabrikam's note on the invoice just says it covers replacing 3 smart meters. It doesn't ask for anything unusual, like a different address or a rush.\n\nNothing else needs your attention. Once PAY-001 is approved, the invoice will be settled.",
